Recommends: fonts-noto-color-emoji
Description: multilingual clipboard and character picker for GNOME Shell
 ClipNacre adds a Windows-style Super+V shell popup with searchable
 text/image clipboard history, screenshots, emoji, kaomoji, symbols and GIFs.
 Seven interface languages and localized emoji search are bundled. It uses
 GNOME's Wayland clipboard and virtual keyboard APIs without a daemon.
 Screenshots can be annotated, pinned to the screen and recognized with
 local OCR. Users enable the extension in their own GNOME Wayland session.
